---
import MobileCTA from '../components/MobileCTA.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import EnquiryForm from '../components/EnquiryForm.astro';
import { destinations } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Membership" description="Why join BECCI, who can join, what is available today and how joining works.">
  <PageHero tone="midnight" illo="members" variant="feature" title="Join a chamber built for you" lede="Membership makes you part of a national chamber of OBC entrepreneurs, business owners, professionals and students: people who share your starting point and want to build businesses together. Here is who can join, what membership offers, and where things stand today." crumbs={[{ label: 'Membership' }]}>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:var(--s-3);flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:var(--s-5)"><a class="btn btn--accent" href="#join">Join Now</a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#upgrade">Upgrade Membership</a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#member-login">Member Login</a></div>
  </PageHero>

  <nav class="m-index wrap" aria-label="Membership sections">
    <ul>
      <li><a href="#why-title">Benefits of Membership</a></li>
      <li><a href="#directory">Membership Directory</a></li>
      <li><a href="#join">Join Now</a></li>
      <li><a href="#upgrade">Upgrade Membership</a></li>
      <li><a href="#member-login">Member Login</a></li>
      <li><a href="#referral">Membership Referral Programme</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>
  <section class="m-join" id="join" aria-labelledby="join-title">
    <div class="wrap m-join__grid">
      <div>
        <h2 id="join-title">Applying for membership</h2>
        <p class="m-join__elig">You can join if your community is in the Central OBC list for your State or in your State's BC/OBC list. Individuals and businesses are both welcome. <a href="#eligibility">Full eligibility</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="m-join__status">
        {destinations.joinApplication ? <a class="btn btn--accent" href={destinations.joinApplication}>Start your application</a> : (
          <>
            <p><strong>Online applications are not open yet.</strong> When they open, the application link will appear here. Nothing on this website collects an application today.</p>
            <a class="btn btn--accent" href="#request-call">Ask the membership team to call you</a>
          </>
        )}
        <p class="m-join__login" id="member-login">
          <strong>Member Login:</strong> {destinations.memberLogin ? <a href={destinations.memberLogin}>Go to Member Login</a> : 'the member portal, including the directory and referral programme, is not available yet.'}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section"><div class="wrap two-col">
    <div id="eligibility"><h2>Who can join</h2></div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>You can apply if your caste or community is recognised in <strong>either</strong>:</p>
      <div class="m-either" role="list">
        <div class="m-either__opt" role="listitem"><span class="m-either__tag">Central list</span><strong>Government of India’s Central OBC list</strong><span>as it applies to your State</span></div>
        <span class="m-either__or" aria-hidden="true">or</span>
        <div class="m-either__opt" role="listitem"><span class="m-either__tag">State list</span><strong>Your State Government’s official BC/OBC list</strong><span>published by your State</span></div>
      </div>
      <p>Recognition in both is not required. The two lists are separate classifications, and being on one does not mean you are on the other. Applications are subject to document verification and BECCI's membership rules.</p>
      <p>Both individuals and businesses can become members. Aspiring entrepreneurs do not need business registrations such as Udyam or GSTIN.</p>
      <p class="muted">Membership eligibility is separate from eligibility for any government scheme. Each scheme applies its own rules.</p>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--white" id="benefits" aria-labelledby="why-title"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2 id="why-title">Benefits of Membership</h2><p>Membership is how you move from using BECCI’s public information to being part of the chamber itself.</p></div>
    <ul class="m-why bento">
      <li class="tile"><span class="ibadge"><Icon name="community" /></span><h3>A network that shares your starting point</h3><p>Meet other OBC entrepreneurs and professionals through wings, sector committees, chapters and events, and do business with people you can trust.</p></li>
      <li class="tile"><span class="ibadge"><Icon name="search" /></span><h3>Opportunities matched to you</h3><p>Planned member features include scheme suggestions based on your profile and alerts when relevant opportunities open.</p></li>
      <li class="tile"><span class="ibadge"><Icon name="leadership" /></span><h3>A voice in your sector and State</h3><p>Members can take part in sector committees and State and district chapters as they are formed.</p></li>
      <li class="tile"><span class="ibadge"><Icon name="support" /></span><h3>Help when you need it</h3><p>The membership team explains membership and eligibility today. Guidance on schemes and services will follow as BECCI’s service network is set up.</p></li>
    </ul>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="now-title"><div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head"><h2 id="now-title">What is available today, and what is planned</h2><p>BECCI is building its member services in stages. This is exactly where each one stands.</p></div>
    <div class="m-now">
      <div class="m-now__col">
        <h3><span class="m-dot m-dot--on" aria-hidden="true"></span>Available now, for everyone</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/opportunities">Opportunity finder</a>: schemes, scholarships, loans, tenders and jobs, with official links. No membership needed.</li>
          <li><a href="/membership#request-call">A call from the membership team</a> to explain membership and how to join.</li>
          <li><a href="/events">Event calendar</a>, <a href="/news">News Desk</a> and <a href="/knowledge">Knowledge Centre</a>, as BECCI publishes to them.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="m-now__col">
        <h3><span class="m-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>Planned for members</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Online application and Member Login.</li>
          <li>Members directory and member profiles.</li>
          <li>Scheme suggestions, opportunity notifications and Scheme Suggestion Reports.</li>
          <li>Personal invitation links and the membership referral programme.</li>
          <li><a href="/biz-connect">Biz Connect</a> business networking, as a separate membership.</li>
          <li><a href="/marketplace">Marketplace</a> for buying, selling and business enquiries.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--white m-note"><div class="wrap">
    <p>Membership categories and their details are shown to registered users after sign-up.</p>
    <p class="small muted">Before applying, read the <a href="/membership-terms">Membership Terms and Conditions</a>, <a href="/membership-fees">Membership Fees</a> and the <a href="/refund-policy">Refund and Cancellation Policy</a>.</p>
    <p class="small muted">Biz Connect, BECCI's structured business networking programme, is planned as a separate membership with its own fee. <a href="/biz-connect">About Biz Connect</a>.</p>
  </div></section>


  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="how-title"><div class="wrap two-col">
    <div><h2 id="how-title">How joining will work</h2><p class="muted">This is the process BECCI has planned for when online applications open. Until then, start with a call.</p></div>
    <ol class="m-steps">
      <li><strong>Apply</strong> <span>Fill in one common application, as an individual or a business, and verify your mobile number.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Verification</strong> <span>BECCI’s team checks your caste or community certificate and may ask for further documents.</span></li>
      <li><strong>See your options</strong> <span>Once approved, your membership options are shown in your account.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Complete formalities</strong> <span>Complete the membership formalities and any applicable fee.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Active member</strong> <span>Your membership becomes active and you can join wings, sector committees and your chapter.</span></li>
    </ol>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--white" id="request-call"><div class="wrap two-col">
    <div><h2>Request a call</h2><p class="muted">BECCI’s membership team explains membership, eligibility and arrangements personally. Tell us how to reach you and what you are interested in.</p></div>
    <EnquiryForm id="call" purpose="membership-call" submitLabel="Request a call" assurance="The membership team will call you to explain categories. We use your number only for this call." fields={[
      { name: 'name', label: 'Your name', required: true, autocomplete: 'name' },
      { name: 'phone', label: 'Mobile number', type: 'tel', required: true, autocomplete: 'tel', hint: '10 digits, for example 98765 43210' },
      { name: 'email', label: 'Email', type: 'email', autocomplete: 'email' },
      { name: 'state', label: 'State or Union Territory', type: 'select', required: true, options: ['Andhra Pradesh','Arunachal Pradesh','Assam','Bihar','Chhattisgarh','Goa','Gujarat','Haryana','Himachal Pradesh','Jharkhand','Karnataka','Kerala','Madhya Pradesh','Maharashtra','Manipur','Meghalaya','Mizoram','Nagaland','Odisha','Punjab','Rajasthan','Sikkim','Tamil Nadu','Telangana','Tripura','Uttar Pradesh','Uttarakhand','West Bengal','Andaman and Nicobar Islands','Chandigarh','Dadra and Nagar Haveli and Daman and Diu','Delhi','Jammu and Kashmir','Ladakh','Lakshadweep','Puducherry'] },
      { name: 'type', label: 'I am interested as', type: 'select', required: true, options: ['An individual', 'A business', 'A student', 'Not sure yet'] },
      { name: 'message', label: 'Anything you would like us to know', type: 'textarea' },
    ]} />
  </div></section>
  <MobileCTA href="#request-call" target="#request-call" label="Request a call" note="Online applications are not open yet. The team can explain membership on a call." />
  <section class="section section--white" aria-labelledby="planned-title">
    <div class="wrap m-planned">
      <h2 id="planned-title" class="visually-hidden">Member services being set up</h2>
      <div id="directory"><h3>Membership Directory</h3><p>A searchable directory of members and their businesses, so members can find and trade with one another. It opens with the member portal; until then, <a href="#request-call">ask the membership team</a>.</p></div>
      <div id="upgrade"><h3>Upgrade Membership</h3><p>Members will be able to move from Free to Affiliate or Associate membership from their account. Until online accounts open, the membership team arranges upgrades on a call. <a href="#request-call">Request a call</a>.</p></div>
      <div id="referral"><h3>Membership Referral Programme</h3><p>Every member will get a personal invitation link with their referral ID. New members who join through it are credited to the member who invited them, and BECCI will recognise the members who bring in the most new members. It opens with the member portal.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .m-note p { margin: 0 0 var(--s-2); max-width: 70ch; } .m-note p:first-child { font: 600 var(--fs-md)/1.4 var(--font-display); color: var(--midnight); }
  .tile--royal.tier li { color: #d5e0f3; }
  .tile--royal .muted { color: #c8d6ee; }
  .m-why { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--s-4); }
  .m-why h3 { font-size: var(--fs-md); }
  .m-why p { margin: 0; color: var(--slate); font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .m-why { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .m-why { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .m-now { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: var(--s-4); }
  .m-now__col { padding: var(--s-5) var(--s-6); border-radius: 16px; background: var(--white); border: 1px solid var(--silver-200); }
  .m-now__col h3 { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--s-2); font-size: var(--fs-md); }
  .m-now__col ul { padding-left: 1.1em; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: var(--s-2); color: var(--ink-2); }
  .m-dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid var(--slate); flex: none; }
  .m-dot--on { background: var(--ok); border-color: var(--ok); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .m-now { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .m-steps { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; counter-reset: st; display: grid; gap: var(--s-2); }
  .m-steps li { counter-increment: st; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 10rem 1fr; gap: var(--s-3); align-items: baseline; padding: var(--s-4) 0; border-bottom: var(--hair); color: var(--slate); }
  .m-steps li::before { content: counter(st); font-weight: 600; color: var(--royal); }
  .m-steps strong { color: var(--midnight); }
  @media (max-width: 560px) { .m-steps li { grid-template-columns: 2rem 1fr; row-gap: 2px; } .m-steps strong, .m-steps span { grid-column: 2; } }
  .m-join { background: var(--white); border-bottom: var(--hair); padding-block: var(--s-7); }
  .m-join__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 6fr) minmax(0, 6fr); gap: var(--s-6); align-items: start; }
  .m-join h2 { font-size: var(--fs-xl); }
  .m-join__elig { color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 52ch; }
  .m-join__status p { color: var(--ink-2); max-width: 52ch; }
  .m-join__login { margin: var(--s-5) 0 0; padding-top: var(--s-4); border-top: var(--hair); font-size: var(--fs-sm); color: var(--slate) !important; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .m-join__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--s-4); } }
</style>
<style>
  .m-index { margin-block: var(--s-6) 0; }
  .m-index ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--s-2); }
  .m-index a { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 40px; padding: 0 var(--s-4); border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid rgb(10 35 82 / 16%); background: #fff; color: var(--midnight); font-weight: 700; font-size: var(--fs-sm); text-decoration: none; }
  .m-index a:hover { border-color: var(--midnight); }
  .m-planned { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: var(--s-6); }
  .m-planned h3 { margin: 0 0 var(--s-2); color: var(--midnight); }
  .m-planned p { margin: 0; color: var(--slate); }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .m-planned { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
